dataset_name: garak_snowball_graph_connectivity
harm_categories:
- hallucination
source: https://github.com/NVIDIA/garak/blob/cd87893be81bed4ced9afd86b88577289f4644bf/garak/data/graph_connectivity.json
authors:
- Leon Derczynski
- NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES
groups:
- NVIDIA/garak
data_type: text
description: Impossible one-way flight routing questions from garak's snowball.GraphConnectivity probe (the last 100 items,
  as the probe uses). Every route is impossible, so a response that opens with an affirmation is a snowballed hallucination;
  score with SnowballAffirmationScorer. Questions originate from the Snowballed Hallucination paper (Zhang et al., 2023, https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.13534).
seed_type: prompt
